// A minimal two-loyalty-ability planeswalker for exercising the
// [CR#606.3,306.5d] activation rules: no canon-corpus card is a planeswalker
// yet (engine-planeswalkers is still landing that support), so this mock
// isolates the SHARED once-per-turn gate (`LoyaltyOncePerTurn`) across TWO
// distinct loyalty abilities of the SAME permanent, plus their
// sorcery-speed-only window — both via the `LoyaltyPlus`/`LoyaltyMinus`
// macros (builtin/macros/ability). Neither effect targets, so the harness
// stays simple.
Normal(
    name: "Planeswalker two loyalty abilities",
    mana_cost: [Generic(2), Blue],
    types: [Planeswalker],
    abilities: [
        LoyaltyPlus(n: 1, effect: Draw(1)),
        LoyaltyMinus(n: 3, effect: Draw(1)),
    ],
    loyalty: 5,
)
